    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just doesn't feel like there's anything to go back to. i try to act normal and talk to people but they just... they just recoil. or they give me that pitying look. like i'm some mistake that everyone's decided to just ignore. i'm so tired of fighting for a place in a world that's already decided i don't belong there.",
